ts{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-13T17:50:35Z","updated_at":"2025-11-13T17:51:52Z","body":"> Could verbose and recovery mode be made a sub-menu of the Open in Editor item?\r\n\r\nSo like\r\n\r\nOpen in Editor\r\n- Regular Mode\r\n- Verbose Mode\r\n- Recovery Mode\r\n\r\n?\r\n\r\n> I suppose the regular Open in Editor could be removed from this menu, since if you wanted to do that you might just double-click...?\r\n\r\nThat doesn't sound discoverable. Users will wonder where is the regular edit option.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3529003104/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3529020406","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112733#issuecomment-3529020406","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112733","id":3529020406,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7SWJP2","user":{"login":"Meorge","id":9957987,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5NTc5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9957987?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge","html_url":"https://github.com/Meorge","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/gists{/gist_id}","s